cdoc-shape follows the OpenType shaping model and default-shaper behaviour that HarfBuzz
(https://harfbuzz.github.io/, Old MIT licence) established, and is tested against it for
equivalence; it is an independent implementation, and no HarfBuzz code was copied into it.

The default faces in fonts/ (Carlito) are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
fonts/OFL-Carlito.txt and fonts/manifest.json.
